          "speaker": "Chantal",
          "text": "She did. She kept saying things like ‘I know you all think this, but …’ and then she’d tell us how it really is."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-13",
          "speaker": "Hugo",
          "text": "Perhaps she thinks students are a bit narrow-minded about the industry."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-14",
          "speaker": "Chantal",
          "text": "It was a bit harsh, though! We know it’s a tough industry."
