          "id": "p3-15",
          "speaker": "Hugo",
          "text": "Yeah - and we’re only first years, after all. We’ve got a lot to learn."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-16",
          "speaker": "Chantal",
          "text": "Exactly. Do you think our secondary-school education should have been more career-focused?"
        },
