          "id": "p3-17",
          "speaker": "Hugo",
          "text": "Well, we had numerous talks on careers, which was good, but none of them were very inspiring. They could have asked more people like today’s speaker to talk to us."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-18",
          "speaker": "Chantal",
          "text": "I agree. We were told about lots of different careers - just when we needed to be, but not by the experts who really know stuff."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-19",
          "speaker": "Hugo",
          "text": "So did today’s talk influence your thoughts on what career you’d like to take up in the future?"
